{"time": 1763038672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "131423879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"地下室都有啥东西？\""}
{"time": 1763038681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1468746866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这个我还真知道...”"}
{"time": 1763038695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015343645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"不急着杀吧，在这里没办法问的很详细，打晕了带回去好了\""}
{"time": 1763038712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305209909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“几位大人知道外面山上的那两个大柱子吧”"}
{"time": 1763038714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435283916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还要问得很详细吗？\""}
{"time": 1763038727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118072199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 啥来着？"}
{"time": 1763038764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727363438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1431069953]（这个地方有提到）"}
{"time": 1763038772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022052024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（在之前的话就太久远了）"}
{"time": 1763038796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "653001669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"知道，然后呢？\""}
{"time": 1763038896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1070808922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个柱子其实不是普通的柱子，而是一种叫做星之柱的柱子”"}
{"time": 1763038998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "11585948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“那有什么用”"}
{"time": 1763039003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633824845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且那个柱子不止有两个，一开始其实有三个，第三个原址就在这所庄园这里，大家都以为被劳尔斯家族拆了，但其实他们偷偷把柱子藏到了地下，做研究”"}
{"time": 1763039027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "610377883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“这个柱子可以召唤魔神吗”"}
{"time": 1763039031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887524099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“还是可能干什么”"}
{"time": 1763039049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186206014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“梅里森大人不是抓了很多人么，她抓那些人就是为了献祭，只要在柱子前面高呼黄衣之王的名号，在把人杀了就可以完成仪式，给柱子充能...”"}
{"time": 1763039096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "496359747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“柱子充能之后，只要拿着这个东西”他掏出黄印“就可以在城镇里传送，但会凭白无故的多一些壁画...你们之前应该见到过”"}
{"time": 1763039148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "561446646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且我之前听他们说，每一根柱子都连往一个神秘的世界”"}
{"time": 1763039168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023432899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“原来是黄伊之王”"}
{"time": 1763039168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189197294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“只要把能量充满，就可以召唤出至高无上的黄衣之王”"}
{"time": 1763039172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140690102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“那是谁”"}
{"time": 1763039175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105645583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“原来是黄伊之王”"}
{"time": 1763039181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133803074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "过个宗教？"}
{"time": 1763039210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1029514392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+13 宗教"}
{"time": 1763039210, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1029514392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[沙耶]使用[宗教]演奏出:[1D20+13={11}+13=24]"}
{"time": 1763039214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400932238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"柱子要分别充能还是一起算的？\""}
{"time": 1763039218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341906654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"区区黄衣之王\""}
{"time": 1763039223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "207811492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过囊中之物\""}
{"time": 1763039328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265943223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=400932238][CQ:at,qq=1009793416] “不同的柱子连往的世界是不同的...梅里森大人似乎用了一些仪式，但只激活了这个柱子”"}
{"time": 1763039382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402010407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"啧居然这样的麻烦还能有两个\""}
{"time": 1763039404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779905214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"那劳伦斯走了，是因为他已经把柱子充能好了？\""}
{"time": 1763039410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950692622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2023432899]（黄衣之王之前的介绍好像给过来着）"}
{"time": 1763039459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051661730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“似乎不是....劳尔斯爵士好像不太清楚柱子的事情...他好像研究的是另外一条路子，所以他其实对梅里森大人做的事情也不是很清楚”"}
{"time": 1763039551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "613702588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“啊？”"}
{"time": 1763039731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1172232846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"还有这事…那地下室还有你们多少人\""}
{"time": 1763039738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1793064916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们也不太清楚劳尔斯到底想干嘛，但他好像非常想去一个城市...叫什么卡尔克萨”"}
{"time": 1763039749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845947302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"梅丽森是不是也在下面？\""}
{"time": 1763039762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "669279988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是的，梅里森大人在下面”"}
{"time": 1763039796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267971218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“然后还有一些从冰原来的人，也是被梅里森找来的”"}
{"time": 1763039878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "276755586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还有一些她从奇奇怪怪的地方弄来的东西，我也不是很懂..也不敢问”"}
{"time": 1763039925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859273058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"行吧，那下面大概啥地形，给我们画一下\""}
{"time": 1763039957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269121721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“我觉得现在要问的差不多了，关于劳伦斯的部分带回去再问？”"}
{"time": 1763039973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610301921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（劳尔斯（））"}
