{"time": 1763214548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1371725033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哈斯塔？差不多吧，很久很久以前确实是这样，不过那些家伙已经死了就是了”"}
{"time": 1763214593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096915192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我在这里沉眠了好久...最近才被人唤醒”"}
